# §3 · CALIBRATION

`act` for e1 · e2 · e3 · g3 · g4 exists only as a D1 `policies` row written by Workflow `pv-calibrate`
(BP§10). Protocol: ≥ 20 labelled items · sweep 0.50/0.60/0.70/0.80/0.90 · max < 0.5 → the question is
broken (rewrite, bump version) · spread < 0.25 → no discrimination · positive control ≥ 0.85 and
negative ≤ 0.15 · choose false_allow = 0 with max recall. A surface with no row → `Refusal
E_UNCALIBRATED`; the run stops.

