```
MISREAD_VALUE      cf/src/steps/clairic.ts      field schema / invariant
CAPTURE_WRONG      cf/src/steps/capture.ts, selectors.ts
TIER_PROMOTION     cf/src/e1/zfp.ts             B.1 conjunction
RECEIPT_BROKEN     cf/src/e1/zfp.ts, context.ts modifier gate input
ZONE_WRONG         cf/src/e1/build.ts           levels / cluster / confluence / roles
UNLICENSED_SHAPE   cf/src/e2/candidates.ts      LICENSED table
CHAIN_WRONG        cf/src/e2/chain.ts           walk / TRANSITION / days / alt
GEOMETRY_WRONG     cf/src/e3/setups.ts          entry / sl / tp / composite / kills
REPLAY_SIDE_EFFECT cf/src/workflow/*.ts         a write outside step.do
RENDER_WRONG       pine/plutus-vision.pine      parse / draw / anchor
CLAIM_FALSE        the executor's claim         (the code is not changed)
```
2nd occurrence of a class → add a check to the owning gate + a fixture pair, re-pin at the next P0
maintenance turn. Three failed rounds on one gate → stop; write `PROOF/<turn>/census.md`; re-derive.

